[version]
1.6.5
[date]
2026-10-22
[whatsnew]
- FIXED: Mouse scroll + mouse_up crashes (same unpack bug as before)
  - mouse_up also used `local _,_,x,y = unpack(event)` (5 from 4)
  - Now reads event[2], event[3], event[4] directly with nil checks
- FIXED: Pinestore install "succeeds" but installs nothing
  - Install scripts from pinestore.cc print "Out of space!" and exit
    without raising a Lua error, so pcall returns true
  - Now checks if any files were actually created after install
  - If no files created: returns error "no files created (out of space?)"
  - Also checks if files went to /disk (floppy disk)
- NEW: Apps menu has CATEGORIES!
  - System: Terminal, Files, Editor, Settings, System Monitor, etc.
  - Apps: Paint, Notes, Calculator, Clock, Music, Web Browser, etc.
  - Games: (for future pinestore game installs)
  - Utils: everything else
  - Category headers shown in yellow, non-clickable
  - Apps under each header shown with indent
- NEW: Menu multi-column support
  - If apps list is too long for one column (taller than screen)
  - Automatically splits into 2 columns side by side
  - Both columns are clickable
[/whatsnew]
[files]
de/gui.lua
bin/pinestore.lua
latest_update.upd
[/files]
